{"id":"n14688-1-7","stage":4,"title":"갈대 · 芦苇","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14688-1-7-1","ko":"가을이 되니 갈대에 꽃이 핀다.","zh":"到了秋天，芦苇上就会开花。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가을이","audio":"/audio/9c786870b862ca6b7399.mp3"}},{"text":"되니","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되니","audio":"/audio/49977e7991da87edfe97.mp3"}},{"text":"갈대에","meaning":"芦苇","explanation":"갈대：芦苇；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"갈대","audio":"/audio/84bcd17e735e70a10e60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14688","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈대에","audio":"/audio/34209bd9b1621dd13b0d.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃이","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃이","audio":"/audio/f25b5e087f67c87a714a.mp3"}},{"text":"핀다.","meaning":"开","explanation":"피다：开；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"피다","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73270","senseId":"1","lemma":"피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"핀다","audio":"/audio/ae1e03b5a08c07f005d9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"84bcd17e735e70a1","term":"갈대","zh":"芦苇","audio":"/audio/84bcd17e735e70a10e60.mp3","entryId":"14688","definition":"在湿地或水边成林生长的茎又细又长的草。","pronunciation":["갈때"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"aef10307b7c8f727","term":"피다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3","entryId":"73270","definition":"花骨朵或叶子等开放。","pronunciation":["피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d13685a3e7fbd1931460.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14688-1-7-2","ko":"응, 꽃이 꼭 솜털 같아.","zh":"嗯，那些花看起来简直就像绒毛一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃이","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃이","audio":"/audio/f25b5e087f67c87a714a.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"仿佛，好像","explanation":"꼭：仿佛，好像。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"3","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"솜털","meaning":"绒毛，茸毛","explanation":"솜털：绒毛，茸毛。","readings":[{"term":"솜털","audio":"/audio/dbc400557d0799451018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64474","senseId":"2","lemma":"솜털","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솜털","audio":"/audio/dbc400557d0799451018.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"仿佛，好像","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"非常相似地。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"dbc400557d079945","term":"솜털","zh":"绒毛，茸毛","audio":"/audio/dbc400557d0799451018.mp3","entryId":"64474","definition":"纤细又柔软的毛。","pronunciation":["솜ː털"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec79163c4888c67f2f10.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.969,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14688","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，那些花看起来简直就像绒毛一样。","到了秋天，芦苇上就会开花。","行李不会太多吧？看起来都快装不下了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["到了秋天，芦苇上就会开花。","行李不会太多吧？看起来都快装不下了。","嗯，那些花看起来简直就像绒毛一样。"],"answer":2}]}
